# Realtek RTL9617C (Cortina "Taurus") SoC

config SOC_RTL9617C
	bool
	help
	  Realtek RTL9617C, a 64-bit ARM SoC of the Cortina "Taurus" family.
	  It provides the NI Ethernet MAC, a SPI NAND controller, a Cortina
	  UART and the GPIO block used by the boards based on it.
